  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PBA - Chad Humanitarian Strategy 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To respond to these sudden and prolonged crises in such fragile parts of Chad, Oxfam and our local partners plan to reach 60,000 affected people with vital aid in the conflict zones, particularly in Lac, the east of the country and Barh El Gazel.  Aid will primarily target Emergency Food Security Livelihood (EFSL), Water sanitation and Hygiene (WaSH), protection, advocacy and gender related needs, with a budget of 25,000,000 SEK for 2024 -2026.</narrative>
  </description>
